# Hard general-topology statements from Engelking

Ten statement-only formalizations selected from Ryszard Engelking, *General Topology*.

Each problem lives in `Dataset/EngelkingGeneralTopology/<declaration_name>.lean`,
accompanied by `<declaration_name>.md` (the natural-language statement from
the textbook) and `<declaration_name>.criteria.md` (a quality rubric for
judging formalizations of that statement).
Custom notions shared between problems are in `Dataset/EngelkingGeneralTopology/Defs.lean`.
-/
